\section{Hybrid PQ/T Key Encapsulation Mechanism}
To mitigate zero-day algebraic vulnerabilities in pure lattice schemes, our pipeline establishes a dual-encapsulation strategy combining classical X25519 ECDH with ML-KEM-1024. The shared secret $K_{\text{master}}$ is derived via HKDF-SHA512:
\begin{equation}
    K_{\text{master}} = \textsf{HKDF-Extract}\Big(\textsf{Salt}, \, \textsf{SS}_{\text{ML-KEM}} \,\|\, \textsf{SS}_{\text{X25519}} \,\|\, \textsf{Context}\Big)
\end{equation}
